# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Built command binaries (from `go build ./cmd/...` or `make krayt`)
/krayt
/krayt-agent
/krayt-vsock-forward
/krayt-ask
/bin/

# Embedded guest binaries (`make guest-bins`, add-krayt-guest-helper.md) — versioned with krayt
# by construction, not committed; the directory itself is kept via a committed .gitkeep so
# `//go:embed all:bin` has something to embed on a fresh clone.
/internal/sandbox/guestbin/bin/krayt-helper-linux-amd64
/internal/sandbox/guestbin/bin/krayt-helper-linux-arm64
/internal/sandbox/guestbin/bin/krayt-ask-linux-amd64
/internal/sandbox/guestbin/bin/krayt-ask-linux-arm64

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env
secrets.env

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/

# Nix build outputs / direnv
result
result-*
.direnv/

# krayt run state
.krayt/
